WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.996 --> 00:00:17.529
Jordan and were screaming at the top of their lungs.

2
00:00:17.549 --> 00:00:20.352
"TV! TV!

3
00:00:20.712 --> 00:00:22.654
We want to watch TV!"

4
00:00:24.275 --> 00:00:29.860
Vinnie and Mandy's parents had gone shopping with Uncle Wilson and Aunt Leah.

5
00:00:31.620 --> 00:00:37.743
Before leaving, Aunt Leah had said: "No TV for Jordan and Scarlet."

6
00:00:39.323 --> 00:00:42.164
"You're not allowed," began Vinnie.

7
00:00:43.205 --> 00:00:46.186
The twins started screaming again.

8
00:00:46.206 --> 00:00:48.807
"How about some ice cream!"

9
00:00:50.368 --> 00:00:52.508
Mandy said, clapping her hands.

10
00:00:52.528 --> 00:00:54.549
"Ice cream?"

11
00:00:55.049 --> 00:00:55.990
cried Scarlet.

12
00:00:56.010 --> 00:01:03.029
"We have chocolate and strawberry," said Mandy, walking toward the kitchen.

13
00:01:04.170 --> 00:01:05.931
The twins followed quietly.

14
00:01:07.172 --> 00:01:08.673
Vinnie wiped his forehead.

15
00:01:08.693 --> 00:01:11.375
"Babysitting is hard.

16
00:01:11.735 --> 00:01:14.417
I need a break," he said to himself.

17
00:01:15.538 --> 00:01:19.721
Vinnie started for his bedroom, and then changed his mind.

18
00:01:20.681 --> 00:01:22.222
He walked up to the attic.

19
00:01:22.242 --> 00:01:26.685
"I wonder if I should thought Vinnie.

20
00:01:26.705 --> 00:01:28.727
"No, I can't.

21
00:01:29.087 --> 00:01:30.148
Mandy will be mad.

22
00:01:30.508 --> 00:01:35.610
But she's downstairs having ice cream Vinnie found the album.

23
00:01:36.871 --> 00:01:40.552
"I'm only going to take a peek," he said to himself.

24
00:01:40.572 --> 00:01:44.014
"I'll close it if I see a glowing picture."

25
00:01:45.354 --> 00:01:47.735
He sat down and opened the album.

26
00:01:48.916 --> 00:01:52.257
At the same time, Mandy burst into the attic.

27
00:01:52.277 --> 00:01:54.318
"I knew it!"

28
00:01:54.818 --> 00:01:55.519
she shouted.

29
00:01:55.539 --> 00:01:58.760
"I knew you would try to go without me!"

30
00:01:59.948 --> 00:02:03.949
"But I well I Vinnie stammered.

31
00:02:04.970 --> 00:02:07.470
Mandy snatched the album from his hands.

32
00:02:08.551 --> 00:02:09.911
A photo was glowing.

33
00:02:09.931 --> 00:02:14.212
"Oh, how strange!"

34
00:02:14.953 --> 00:02:15.833
she gasped.

35
00:02:17.213 --> 00:02:19.894
Vinnie got up and looked over her shoulder.

36
00:02:20.994 --> 00:02:25.856
The old man stood between two statues of scary-looking animals.

37
00:02:27.288 --> 00:02:31.909
They had big eyes and huge mouths with many sharp teeth.

38
00:02:33.230 --> 00:02:36.090
Behind the statues was a tall structure.

39
00:02:37.191 --> 00:02:38.731
It was glowing brightly.

40
00:02:42.952 --> 00:02:47.334
looks like rooftops stacked on top of each other," remarked Vinnie.

41
00:02:47.354 --> 00:02:50.614
"I wonder where this could be?"

42
00:02:51.295 --> 00:02:52.095
said Mandy.

43
00:02:52.115 --> 00:02:56.156
"I don't know, but Vinnie paused.

44
00:02:56.856 --> 00:02:57.857
"Where are the twins?"

45
00:02:59.218 --> 00:03:04.664
Just as Vinnie asked that question, Jordan and Scarlet appeared at the door.

46
00:03:06.165 --> 00:03:11.530
And at that exact moment, Vinnie and Mandy fell down the dark tunnel.

47
00:03:11.550 --> 00:03:15.935
"Hey!" cried Mandy.

48
00:03:15.955 --> 00:03:19.178
"Whoa!" cried Vinnie.

49
00:03:19.198 --> 00:03:27.246
"Hooray!" shouted people as they clapped loudly.

50
00:03:27.266 --> 00:03:31.309
"Huh?" Vinnie opened his eyes.

51
00:03:32.389 --> 00:03:35.792
He was lying on a stage in front of lots of people.

52
00:03:36.432 --> 00:03:37.833
Mandy was next to him.

53
00:03:37.853 --> 00:03:40.235
"What's going on?"

54
00:03:40.955 --> 00:03:42.476
she whispered to her brother.

55
00:03:42.496 --> 00:03:45.418
"Wasn't that amazing?"

56
00:03:46.139 --> 00:03:48.040
A man stood in front of them.

57
00:03:49.121 --> 00:03:50.842
He was waving to the crowd.

58
00:03:50.862 --> 00:03:53.604
"Come back for our next show!"

59
00:03:54.684 --> 00:03:56.146
The crowd moved away.

60
00:03:57.567 --> 00:04:00.389
Then the man turned and looked down at them.

61
00:04:00.409 --> 00:04:02.391
"Who are you?"

62
00:04:02.992 --> 00:04:04.113
he said, stunned.

63
00:04:04.133 --> 00:04:05.854
"How did you do that?"

64
00:04:05.874 --> 00:04:07.676
"Do what?"

65
00:04:08.336 --> 00:04:09.037
asked Vinnie.

66
00:04:09.057 --> 00:04:14.322
"It looked as if you fell from the sky," he said, pointing up.

67
00:04:15.703 --> 00:04:18.045
"I am Samir the great magician.

68
00:04:18.866 --> 00:04:21.348
And yet, I cannot explain how you did that."

69
00:04:22.244 --> 00:04:24.565
The children got up and looked around.

70
00:04:24.585 --> 00:04:27.386
"Where are we?"

71
00:04:28.287 --> 00:04:29.087
asked Mandy.

72
00:04:30.027 --> 00:04:31.908
They were in a large square.

73
00:04:34.409 --> 00:04:37.770
Mandy could hear music and the sounds of animals.

74
00:04:39.751 --> 00:04:41.692
Samir laughed.

75
00:04:42.632 --> 00:04:48.114
"You are at a celebration for Master Yuan—an important government official."

76
00:04:48.134 --> 00:04:50.255
"Which government?"

77
00:04:50.996 --> 00:04:51.696
asked Vinnie.

78
00:04:52.849 --> 00:04:54.873
Samir looked at him in surprise.

79
00:04:54.893 --> 00:04:59.803
"Why, the Tang Dynasty of China, of course," he replied.
